{"3366750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Echo Extract", "steam_appid": 3366750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4918250, 4937240], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/a840fdd1338b818947e7453e1bcb319c.avif?t=1786048345\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant Mechs called Mavericks have gone haywire.  They roam the synth-lands attacking anyone who comes near.  Use your sweet moves to bring them down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/f43eb9497f29e25b1b57e36f93c63c28.poster.avif?t=1786048345\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/f43eb9497f29e25b1b57e36f93c63c28.webm?t=1786048345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/f43eb9497f29e25b1b57e36f93c63c28.mp4?t=1786048345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/c798e5569045666b8a8d66c1f414b133.avif?t=1786048345\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take parts from the defeated Mavericks to craft RAD armor.  These crafted armor all come with unique abilities.  Cast lightning on critical strikes, shoot a laser out of your chest, deal explosive damage on combo finishers.  All of this while looking stylish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/871f2bdf26c9e123d200b3ec772eb893.poster.avif?t=1786048345\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/871f2bdf26c9e123d200b3ec772eb893.webm?t=1786048345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/871f2bdf26c9e123d200b3ec772eb893.mp4?t=1786048345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/d0671d7ed6aa121827e195881e0b7fd5.avif?t=1786048345\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build stacks of lethality with the dagger to teleport.  The aegis shield can be ricocheted between groups of enemies.  The hammer gains super armor and brings the pain.  As an Echo you need to master you weapon to take out the neon gangs who rule these rad lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/f9b161693cd4fb77798034f2e65e73c5.poster.avif?t=1786048345\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/f9b161693cd4fb77798034f2e65e73c5.webm?t=1786048345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/f9b161693cd4fb77798034f2e65e73c5.mp4?t=1786048345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/eb034ed17cf471b72b8eed40cb548ec2.avif?t=1786048345\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Echo needs a RAD PAD! Loot all that you can from a raid and bring it back to your hideout to build your base. Your base will unlock new weapons and armor options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/9daec6606008973f7516e51e6f7be9aa.poster.avif?t=1786048345\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/9daec6606008973f7516e51e6f7be9aa.webm?t=1786048345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/9daec6606008973f7516e51e6f7be9aa.mp4?t=1786048345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/a840fdd1338b818947e7453e1bcb319c.avif?t=1786048345\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant Mechs called Mavericks have gone haywire.  They roam the synth-lands attacking anyone who comes near.  Use your sweet moves to bring them down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/f43eb9497f29e25b1b57e36f93c63c28.poster.avif?t=1786048345\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/f43eb9497f29e25b1b57e36f93c63c28.webm?t=1786048345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com